1. Activate Stromkirk Condemned to discard a card (no mana cost)
2. Cast Brilliant Spectrum for {U}{U}{U}{U}
3. Cycle Floodwaters for {B}{B}
4. Cycle Horror of the Broken Lands for {B}
5. Declare all creatures (Shadowstorm Vizier, Archfiend of Ifnir, and Stromkirk Condemned) as attackers
6. After all blocking and damage assignment, this deals exactly 14 damage: Shadowstorm (6) + Archfiend (5) + Stromkirk (3)
